        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film), G-Force\n- People: Dodie Smith, Cruella de Vil, Hoyt Yeatman\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films, Disney\n- Topics: film adaptations, directorial debut\n\nFacts:\n- Dodie Smith wrote the 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\"\n- Cruella de Vil appeared in Dodie Smith's 1956 novel \"The Hundred and One Dalmatians\" and is the main antagonist in Disney's animated and live-action adaptations.\n- 101 Dalmatians is a 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film based on Walt Disney's 1961 animated adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel.\n- G-Force is a 2009 American family comedy adventure film produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.\n- Hoyt Yeatman made his directorial debut with G-Force.",
